{"id":"vod_sn_38965","vodId":"38965","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"斩·赤红之瞳","name_cn":"斩·赤红之瞳","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/edf122903bc9d3cda0ac3a92421a2198.jpg"},"summary":"历经了千年的繁华，巍峨帝都早已从内部腐烂，拥有邪魔灵魂的统治者，正引领文明走向毁灭。为了解除村庄的困境，拥有绝赞剑术的少年塔兹米（齐藤壮马 配音）独闯帝都。此时帝都至高无上的皇帝还只是不谙世事的孩子，国家的实际操纵者大臣只手遮天，是帝都腐朽的根源。历经一波三折，塔兹米被曾经骗过自己的雷欧奈（浅川悠 配音）强行拉入一个神秘组织Night Raid。Night Raid是一支令帝都所有权贵富贾闻风丧胆的暗杀集团，他们是革命军下辖的秘密特殊部队，其最终目标是颠覆大臣的统治。在娜杰塔（水野理纱 配音）的领导下，赤瞳（雨宫天 配音）、雷欧奈等绝世高手云集其下。塔兹米的命运由此发生转折，而接二连三更大的纷争则将其引向未知的彼方……　　本片根据タカヒロ（原作）、田代哲也（原画）的漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:10","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/d5d65935bh1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/acEABRJgGA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/QSZHmcs22t1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5TVPQYfK6k1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/rW0zpBVLKC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/DSG25pmghV1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/kRUCDr1BVA1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cWEN6Nfq7v1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/arp1fTRWsq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/U1W4krg7Mi1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/SL1NaDXcdm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/VgZ4SJQabg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vFVcw7su421/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.c